      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Pickaxes, axes, shovels, shears, and hammers—the alchemical arsenal is vast and varied. By binding Dark Matter to standard tool hilts, you have created a suite of implements designed to conquer the physical world. Whether you are stripping the leaves from a jungle or carving a massive underground vault for your next GT assembly line, these tools are built for extreme terraforming.\n\nFunctionally, there are far too many tools to list individually here, but they all share an incredible mining speed and near-infinite durability.\n\n§lDo not forget to charge them up before use!§r (This is typically bound to the \u0027V\u0027 key). An uncharged Dark Matter tool is just a very fast, very expensive pickaxe. But a fully charged one? It will activate its secondary abilities, allowing you to mine massive areas or fell entire trees with a single click!",
